Rokan Terminal — judge sandbox

This is a throttled Linux container (1/4 vCPU, 1 GiB) that lives for 30 minutes.
You are `judge` (no sudo). Outbound HTTP/S is limited to a few demo hosts.

Try:
  ls; git --version; python3 --version
  echo hello_judge

Then ask your agent (ChatGPT desktop with GPT-5.6 Sol/Terra, or Chrome 149+ with WebMCP)
to propose a command, press Enter, and forge what you just did into a tool.

`rokan do "<question> at <site>"` replays a verified, seeded operation with zero model calls (⚡) — 54
seeded sites; see SKILL.md here. The sandbox has no API key by design: anything unseeded abstains honestly.
